      "content": "We deeply regret that our API has been returning 500 errors and causing so much financial loss for your team; our engineering team is currently investigating the root cause and deploying a hotfix for our team of experts right now. We are working on a plan that will be shared with you every fifteen minutes until the service is restored, and we will personally follow up with your CTO to ensure full transparency once resolved. Thank you for your patience, and we are committed to restoring your checkout flow immediately without further disruption.",
